<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.597 points off FTSE, Sept 9.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.597 points off FTSE, Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on September 9 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 1.597 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Blue Circle Industries		 4.25  5.313  0.228</p>
<p>    * Hanson				     3.00  3.750  0.304</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
